 278:source\asw/main.c **** /**
 279:source\asw/main.c ****  * \brief Initialisation task: start the drivers, the application and the other tasks, then end.
 280:source\asw/main.c ****  *
 281:source\asw/main.c ****  * Runs once after StartOS(). The order of the calls matters (N1):
 282:source\asw/main.c ****  *   1. start the hardware drivers (UART log, sample timer component, LED, seven segment,
 283:source\asw/main.c ****  *      TFT, sound driver),
ARM GAS  C:\Users\agila\AppData\Local\Temp\ccNTsbBI.s 			page 12


 284:source\asw/main.c ****  *   2. EE_system_init() - reconfigures the ISRs with the OS parameters,
 285:source\asw/main.c ****  *   3. MP3_Init() - scan the SD card, draw the TFT header,
 286:source\asw/main.c ****  *   4. start the two alarms, activate the other tasks and terminate itself.
 287:source\asw/main.c ****  *
 288:source\asw/main.c ****  * The return values of SOUND_Init() and MP3_Init() are not evaluated here (N2).
 289:source\asw/main.c ****  *
 290:source\asw/main.c ****  * \note Runs only once. TerminateTask() is the last call.
 291:source\asw/main.c ****  */
