 363:source\asw/main.c ****  * SOUND_isr() sets ev_BufEmpty each time it has switched to the other buffer. The task
 364:source\asw/main.c ****  * wakes up, clears the event and calls MP3_Reader(), which reads the next block from
 365:source\asw/main.c ****  * the SD card, converts it and fills the freed buffer. The reader must finish within
